<title>UK: INDOVER Bank sets $150 million five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>INDOVER Bank sets $150 million five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett, HSBC Markets and Sumitomo Finance.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INDOVER BANK</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     30 BP     PAY DATE    14.JAN.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   25 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    PAR</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
